  - name: Bookwyrm
    portrait: {fileID: -184693960786962222, guid: 85e3c73ee41d345359853fe605fb7935, type: 3}
    themeColor: {r: 0.4, g: 0.55, b: 0.85, a: 1}
    profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 917cec5e14bb0194ea10a5b2396f6a23, type: 2}
    voiceBlip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 60f2e93a3e02b7a4e9100e7a3b50ff4f, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: "Can you believe that a dev was able to make all of this secretly? I heavily
      doubt any of the others didn\u2019t see the changes being made."
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 0
    text: they probably didnt care. are you gonna make a video about it?
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: Oh, without a doubt, I have to! This is a GOLD mine! I could make an entire
      series for this dungeon. You have been paying attention to it, right?
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 0
    text: ye
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: "Ugh, it\u2019s so good. I love it."
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 0
    text: lemme be a part of your vid!
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: You wanna be in my video? How come?
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 0
    text: cuz its awesome duh. the attention we could get by showcasing the best
      player in dreamblade could help you a lot.
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: "I guess, that\u2019s true\u2026"
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 0
    text: also i watched your recent video a couple of times and i have some complaints.
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: Er, what?
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 0
    text: i made a few comments under the video. you should check it out.
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: I, uh, get a lot of comments.
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 0
    text: you dont read all of your comments?
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: "There\u2019s too many! It would take waaaay too long. But, I\u2019ll try
      to find yours!"
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 0
    text: thx.
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: No problem, bro!
    autoProgress: 0
  autoProgressDelay: 1.5
  typingSpeed: 0.05
